Dear Javier,

First of all, my apologies for taking so long to get back to you.  I tried
reading your file using the rNOMADS ReadGrib() function and it was not
successful.  Specifically, it took a very long time and never seemed to
complete.  I share your frustration with reading grib files in R (and in
general).  They are difficult.

rNOMADS is primarily concerned with interfacing with the NOMADS data portal
on the NOAA web site.  Unfortunately, I don't have the time or the
resources to add support for grib files that do not conform to their
standards.  My recommendation is to see if this tool can be used to read
grib time series:
http://www.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/products/wesley/wgrib2/

Regards,

Danny

